'''Patisserie Parklands''' (甘味自然公園, ''Kanmi Shizen Kōen'', '''Sweet Nature Park''') is the 22nd sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 120th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Whilst this sub-chapter may seem to have some difficult stages at first glance, they generally aren't too hard, even with most enemies being 1.2x stronger than usual. The only stages that might take you more than one attempt are [[Tapioca Hills]] and [[Nata de Coco Way]]. Overall, a simple sub-chapter compared to the [[A Journey of Moments|previous one]].

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Ange Lackey]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Tackey]]. Has high health for a Tackey variant (700k), a 50% chance to knockback cats and a 100% chance to create an [[Explosion]] at 600 range, while also standing from 600 range and hitting at 450~750.
*[[Commander Ostromeda]]: An [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[R.Ost]] from [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year#Arrival of the Blue Ship|Arrival of the Blue Ship]], with 290 range and a 15% chance to warp cats back by 800 range for 6.67 seconds.

